# Diffusers docs

- New pages must be registered in `docs/source/<lang>/_toctree.yml` or they
  won't appear on the site (`docs/README.md`). Translations live under
  `docs/source/ko/`, `docs/source/zh/`, etc. — match the English neighbor.
- Docstrings are Google style (see `docs/source/en/conceptual/contribution.md`).
- Don't add images/videos to the repo — host them on a Hub dataset
  (`hf-internal-testing` or `huggingface/documentation-images`).
- Public API changes need a matching `docs/source/en/` update (`.ai/review-rules.md`).

```yaml
# ❌ BAD — new docs/source/en/api/pipelines/foo.md, _toctree.yml untouched

# ✅ GOOD — add a toctree entry
- local: api/pipelines/foo
  title: Foo
```
